===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The sound of a sudden heavy fall.
#* '''1863''', Sheridan Le Fanu, ''{{w|The House by the Churchyard}}''
#*: This dame, as she stepped with a long leg, in a black silk stocking, to the ground, swept the front windows of the house from under her velvet hood with a sharp and evil glance; and in fact she was Mistress Mary Matchwell.<br>As she beheld her, poor Mrs. Mack's heart fluttered up to her mouth, and then dropped with a dreadful '''plump''', into the pit of her stomach.

